 Priority:  CLI args  >  YAML  >  argparse defaults\r\n```"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/335590474","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/335590474/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/335590474/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/tag/v2.0.3","id":335590474,"author":{"login":"lipku","id":5893340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTMzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5893340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lipku/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOK7UGY84UALRK","tag_name":"v2.0.3","target_commitish":"main","name":"v2.0.3","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-06-07T10:20:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T12:01:12Z","published_at":"2026-06-07T12:01:12Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/tarball/v2.0.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/zipball/v2.0.3","body":"### ✨ New Features\r\n\r\n**OmniTTS — vLLM Omni Speech Adapter**\r\n- Added `tts/omnitts.py`, a new TTS backend that calls the vLLM Omni OpenAI-compatible speech API (`POST /v1/audio/speech`). Supports all vLLM Omni models (Qwen3-TTS, Fish Speech S2, CosyVoice3, Voxtral, VoxCPM2, MOSS-TTS-Nano) with configurable source sample rate, automatic resampling to 16 kHz, and per-message parameter overrides (voice, language, speed, instructions, task type).  [usage](https://doc.livetalking.ai/docs/usage/#331-omni-tts)\r\n\r\n**TTS Voice Manager Web UI**\r\n- Added `web/tts/index.html` and `web/tts/index-en.html` — a full-featured voice management dashboard:\r\n  - **Voice list** — browse preset and uploaded voices from the vLLM Omni server, with one-click selection and voice deletion.\r\n  - **Voice clone upload** — upload audio samples to clone new voices with auto-generated consent ID, required reference text, and a browser-native speech recognition button for auto-transcription.\r\n  - **Speech synthesis test** — select a voice, enter text, and synthesize speech with adjustable speed, language (11 languages), output format (WAV/MP3/FLAC/AAC/Opus/PCM), and task type. Results play in-page and are downloadable.\r\n- Added quick-link cards to the main index pages pointing to the TTS manager.\r\n\r\n**Environment Variable Template**\r\n- Added `.env.example` with placeholder keys for Tencent, DashScope, and Doubao services. `python-dotenv` auto-loads `.env` on startup.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2610\" height=\"1312\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89db19ca-4a36-45e9-b86c-c89fde1bbd7e\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","discussion_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/discussions/605"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/328440947","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/328440947/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/328440947/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/releases/tag/v2.0.2","id":328440947,"author":{"login":"lipku","id":5893340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTMzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5893340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.githu